    "updated_at": "2021-11-27T12:00:47Z",
    "body": "> Is your project located in the Windows or WSL file system? File I/O from WSL to the native Windows file system is very slow, leading to higher execution times for `git status`.\r\n\r\nIt is on my Windows drive. But when cd-ing into the project (on the Windows drive) from WSL it works fine. The message only appears when opening the project from vscode.",
