    "updated_at": "2021-12-06T19:01:33Z",
    "body": "Just reporting that this also happens to me in VS Code every time I open the integrated terminal. I see it probably 3/10 times cd'ing into a git directory through an external terminal.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/3211227/144905536-fa6074b9-2278-43bb-ace4-26b6a1f9aa62.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nMy workspace is in Windows, so I assume that is causing the error as mentioned above. I haven't migrated my workspaces into wsl yet. \r\n\r\n\r\n`command_timeout = 10000` solves it for me.\r\n",
