    "updated_at": "2022-11-17T18:05:12Z",
    "body": "To improve performance of `git_status` on Windows, the `windows_starship` option now exists, and it can increase the performance significantly. \r\n\r\nFor example:\r\n```toml\r\n[git_status]\r\nwindows_starship = \"/mnt/c/Users/username/scoop/apps/starship/current/starship.exe\"\r\n \r\n```\r\n\r\nPlease consult [the module documentation](https://starship.rs/config/#git-status) on how to use it in detail.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/starship/starship/issues/comments/1319012657/reactions",
